        "text": "=Generate metadata for an image in valid JSON formar. The output should be an array of objects, where each object has:\n- \"Title\": A short, descriptive title for the image\n- \"Description\": A compelling description of the image for stock photography\n- \"Keywords\": An array pf exactly 25 relevant keywords. The keywords mush have maximum 30 characters.\n\nEnsure the responses is valid JSON without any markdown formatting. Example output:\n[\n  {\n    \"Title\": \"Sunset Over the Ocean\"\n    \"Description\": \"A breathaking view of the sun setting over the cale ocean, with golden hues reflecting off the watre\"\n    \"Keywords\": \"sunset, ocean, water, sea, golden hour, nature, scenic, landscape, travel, peaceful\"\n  }\n]",
